# Placeholder MTL companion for motionhexa.obj.
# When a real material library is dropped in here (with `Kd` diffuse
# entries matched by `usemtl` directives in the OBJ), per-mesh colors
# will be picked up automatically by the wgpu renderer in src/ui/model.rs.
# Until then, the renderer falls back to its built-in default color
# for every mesh group, matching the prior single-color behavior.
